%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a red stroke. The program has one current colour and PDF
% has two, so the content stream sets the stroking colour (`RG`) along
% with the non-stroking one before the stroke, and the rendered line is
% red rather than PDF's initial black.
1 0 0 setrgbcolor 4 setlinewidth 100 100 moveto 300 300 lineto stroke
showpage
